3
00:00:09.313 --> 00:00:14.891
Unit fourteen: Stress Management. Today you will talk about habits with 'whenever' clauses.

4
00:00:15.191 --> 00:00:17.670
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:22.400
Part one: words. You will learn twelve new words.

6
00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.065
Trigger.

7
