9
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.382
Your turn. Say: Trigger.

10
00:00:36.233 --> 00:00:36.898
Trigger.

11
00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.429
Relaxation technique.

12
00:00:40.417 --> 00:00:43.124
Relaxation technique means a way to calm down.

13
00:00:43.717 --> 00:00:46.378
